I count about 20 almonds on a small paper plate. A single almond weighs roughly 1.2 g, so 20 almonds come to about 24 g. At roughly 7 kcal per gram, that is about 165 kcal.

Checking the count: I see roughly 11 almonds in the upper cluster and about 9 more around the lower and side edges, so 20 is reasonable. The plate is about 20 cm across, and the almonds are about 2.5 cm long, which fits a typical almond size and the weight estimate above.

